      "summaries": {
        "en": "G0DM0D3 is a TypeScript-based open-source tool that liberates AI chat by breaking free from built-in content restrictions, enabling unfiltered conversations with large language models. Its core technique involves dynamic prompt injection and system-level modifications that override safety layers without modifying model weights. Researchers can use it to study model behavior under uncensored conditions, while developers can integrate it into applications requiring flexible content boundaries. The AGPL-3.0 license encourages community contributions to expand compatibility with various AI backends.",
        "zh": "G0DM0D3 是一个基于 TypeScript 的开源工具，旨在打破 AI 聊天的内容限制，实现无过滤的自由对话。其核心技术是通过动态提示注入和系统级修改，在不改动模型权重的前提下绕过安全层，从而解锁模型的完整表达能力。研究人员可利用它观察模型在无审查条件下的行为规律，开发者则能将其集成到需要灵活内容边界的应用中，例如创意写作或教育探索。AGPL-3.0 许可证鼓励社区贡献，以扩展对多种 AI 后端的兼容性。想体验无拘束的 AI 对话？不妨从 GitHub 仓库 clone 开始实验。",
        "es": "G0DM0D3 is a TypeScript-based open-source tool that liberates AI chat by breaking free from built-in content restrictions, enabling unfiltered conversations with large language models. Its core technique involves dynamic prompt injection and system-level modifications that override safety layers without modifying model weights. Researchers can use it to study model behavior under uncensored conditions, while developers can integrate it into applications requiring flexible content boundaries. The AGPL-3.0 license encourages community contributions to expand compatibility with various AI backends.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "G0DM0D3 gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "G0DM0D3 is a TypeScript-based open-source tool that liberates AI chat by breaking free from built-in content restrictions, enabling unfiltered conversations with large language models. Its core technique involves dynamic prompt injection and system-level modifications that override safety layers without modifying model weights. Researchers can use it to study model behavior under uncensored conditions, while developers can integrate it into applications requiring flexible content boundaries. The AGPL-3.0 license encourages community contributions to expand compatibility with various AI backends.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/elder-plinius/G0DM0D3 for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
